  FT["BN-S-46-2001-BRUNEI-ECONOMIC-DEVELOPMENT-BOARD-ACT-AMEND-AC2F94"] = {"id":"BN-S-46-2001-BRUNEI-ECONOMIC-DEVELOPMENT-BOARD-ACT-AMEND-AC2F94","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers, Brunei Darussalam (AGC) — LAWS OF BRUNEI / Government Gazette","sourceUrl":"","fetchedAt":"2026-10-10","articleCount":7,"structureMode":"SECTION","title":{"zh":"文莱经济发展局法修正命令 2001","en":"BRUNEI ECONOMIC DEVELOPMENT BOARD ACT AMENDMENT ORDER 2001","orig":null},"level":"law","status":"active","docNumber":"S 46/2001","issuingBody":"Attorney General's Chambers, Brunei Darussalam","promulgatedDate":"2001","completenessNote":"【源件无文本层，本记录为 OCR 补录】源 PDF 为纯扫描图像（无文本层），已用 Windows OCR 引擎识别；本机仅安装**简体中文识别模型**（无英文语言包），故对英文法条的字符准确率有限（易混：l/I、o/0、m/ın、大小写），并可能残留页边条标题。**本记录仅可用于检索定位，不可作为逐字引用依据；逐字引用请以原始 PDF 为准**（见 source.file / sourceFile）。","textQuality":"ocr-windows-zh-Hans","sourceFile":"S-46-2001-BRUNEI-ECONOMIC-DEVELOPMENT-BOARD-ACT-AMENDMENT-ORDER-2001.pdf","country":"BN","countryName":"文莱","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"BN-S-46-2001-BRUNEI-ECONOMIC-DEVELOPMENT-BOARD-ACT-AMEND-AC2F94-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1."},"text":{"en":"This Order may be cited as the Brunei Economic Development Board (Amendment) Order, 2001 and shall commence on lst. June, 2001 · Amendment of section 2 of Chapter 104 ·"}},{"id":"BN-S-46-2001-BRUNEI-ECONOMIC-DEVELOPMENT-BOARD-ACT-AMEND-AC2F94-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2."},"text":{"en":"Section 2 of the Brunei Economic Development Board Act , in this Order referred to as the Act, is amended (a ) by inserting the following three n ew definitions immediately after the definition of \"Board\" \"business enterprise\" means any sole proprietorship, partnership company or co-operative society wherever registered or incorporated under any law for the time being in force in relation to companies, co-operative societies or businesses and engaged in or proposing to engage in any one or more of the following purposes or functions (a ) manufacture and sale Of goods, materials or things or the subjection Of goods, materials or things to any process, including that Of repairs, breaking-up, reconditioning or maintenance; (b ) the exploration for, and exploitation Of, natural resources, including 闰 the working Of a mine, quarry or any Other source Of mineral deposits; or\n\n(ii) the treatment or preparation for the sale, consumption or use, an d the storage or removal, Of any substance from a ny mine, quarry or Other source Of mineral deposits; (c ) transport, dock, water, electricity or gas undertaking, including the business Of wharf-fingers and stevedores; ( 刃 the storage of goods, materials or things; (e ) the working of a plantation ; 1279\n\nBRUNEI DARUSSALAM GOVERNMENT GAZETTE fishing; ) the business of a tourist enterprise; \"Chief Executive Officer\" means the officer appointed under section 7 · 'goods, materials or things\" includes capital or consumer goods of every description, including aircraftg shipsr machinery, food and drugs; ' ( b ) by deleting the definition of \"Managing Director\" · (c ) by deleting the definition of \"Membert' or \"Member of the Board\" and the following is substituted therefor \"Member\" or \"Member of the Board\" means any member of the Board appointed under section 4 , and includes the Chairman , Deputy Chairman and the ex-officio members, (d ) by inserting the following two n ew definitions immediately after the definition of \"MemberTI \"Minister\" means the Minister charged with th e responsibility for industrial development; \"underwrite\" means to contract, with or without conditions, to subscribe for stocks, shares, bonds or debentures of a business enterprise with a view to the resale Of the whole or part of it. \" Substitution of section 4 ·"}},{"id":"BN-S-46-2001-BRUNEI-ECONOMIC-DEVELOPMENT-BOARD-ACT-AMEND-AC2F94-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3."},"text":{"en":"Section 4 of the Act is repealed and the following is substituted therefor \" 4 · ( ) The Board shall consist of — 依 ) a Chairman, who shall be appointed by His Majesty the SuItan and Yang Di-Pertuan; (b ) a Deputy Chairman, who shall be appointed by His Majesty the Sultan and Yang Di-Pertuan; (c ) 3 ex-officio members who shall be the persons for the time being holding the office of the Permanent Secretary of the Ministry of lndustry and Primary Resources, th e Chief Executive Officer and a representative Of the Ministry of Finance, appointed by the Permanent Secretary of the Ministry of Finance, the Minister of Finance or by His Majesty the Sultan and Yang Di-Pertuan; and 1280 0 0 20th. JUNE( 2001 ( no t less than 3 and not more than 5 other members (hereinafter referred to as \"appointed members\") to be appointed by His Majesty the Sultan and Yang Di-Pertuan from amongst persons appearing to him to be qualified as having wide experience of and shown capacity in matters relating to bankingl manufacturing, housing, comrnerce, finance or administration, or to be otherwise suitable fo r appointment by virtue of their special knowledge and experience. \" Amendment of section 7 ·"}},{"id":"BN-S-46-2001-BRUNEI-ECONOMIC-DEVELOPMENT-BOARD-ACT-AMEND-AC2F94-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4."},"text":{"en":"Section 7 of the Act is amended 间 ( b ) 闷 by deleting \"Managing Director't from the first line and substituting \"Chief Executive Officer\" therefor; by deleting subsection 〔 2 ) ; and by deleting \"Managing Director'f from the marginal note and substituting \"Chief Executive Officer\" therefor. Amendment of section 8 ·"}},{"id":"BN-S-46-2001-BRUNEI-ECONOMIC-DEVELOPMENT-BOARD-ACT-AMEND-AC2F94-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5."},"text":{"en":"Section 8 of the Act is amended 间 (b ) 闷 1281 in paragraph (b ) of subsection (l)f by deleting undertake\" immediately after ltpromote\" in the first line and substituting therefor \"undertake, form or participate in' · in paragraph (d ) of subsection (1), by inserting \"with the written approval Of the Minister and the Minister Of Finance, \" immediately before \"to\" in the first line; by deleting \"and\" at the end of paragraph (d ) and inserting the following five n ew paragraphs immediately after paragraph (d ) ()b ) to stimulate the growth, expansion and development of Brunei Darussalam economy by promoting Brunei Darussalam as an lnvestment destination; to formulate investment promotion policies and plans, promotional incentives and marketing strategies to attract foreign and local investments in advanced technology industries and skill-intensive services which enjoy good export market prospects; to promote, facilitate an d assist in the development of industrial activities including export oriented business activities;\n\nBRUNEI DARUSSALAM GOVERNMENT GAZETTE (ddJ to encourage foreign and local industries to upgrade their skill and technological levels through investment in n ew technology, automationt training, research and product development activities; ()e ) supp ort the development of local entrepreneurs and small and medium businesses and assist local companies to expand and upgrade their operations; and \" Amendment Of section 9 ·"}},{"id":"BN-S-46-2001-BRUNEI-ECONOMIC-DEVELOPMENT-BOARD-ACT-AMEND-AC2F94-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6."},"text":{"en":"Section 9 of the Act is amended 间 (b ) (d ) 仞 by inserting \" ( 尸 immediately before \"For\" in the first line; by deleting paragraph ) and substituting therefor the following — \" (a ) acquire, purchase, exchange, sell or lease and hold land, buildings and other immovable property; in p aragraph (c ) by inserting ' acquire\" immediately before purchase\" in the first line; in paragraph by inserting 》 acquire\" immediately before \"purchase\" in the first line, by deleting paragraph 依 ) and substituting therefor the following — \" 依 ) with the written approval of the Minister and the Minister of Finance, underwrite the issue Of stocks, sharesj bonds or debentures by business enterprises; ' by deleting paragraph ( ) and substituting therefor the following — \" ( ) with the written approval of the Minister and the Minister of Finance, guarantee on such terms and conditions as may be agreed upon , loans raised by business enterprises which are floated in the public market; \" by deleting paragraph ( ) and substituting therefore the following — \" ( ) with the written approval of the Minister and the Minister of Finance, grant loans or advances to business enterprises for th e purpose of industrial development; \" 1282 0 0 仞 ( m ) 1283 20th. JUNE, 2001 by deleting paragraph ) and substituting therefor the following _ ' ( ) managet control or supervise business enterprises by nominating directors or advisers or otherwise collaborating with them,t by deleting paragraph ( 0 ) and substituting therefor the following — \" ( 0 ) with the written approval of the Minister and the Minister of Financet establish, sell shares Of, invest in and manage business enterpnses; by deleting paragraph 加 ) and substituting there for the following (p ) provide technical servlce and assistance to business enterprises and to build up a corps of engineering and managerial staff to provides such assistance; by deleting \"tof' from the first line of paragraph (q ) ; by deleting paragraph (r ) and substituting therefor the following — t(r ) act as agents fo r a ny business enterprises;' by substituting a semicolon fo r the fullstop at the end of paragraph (r ) and adding the following six n ew paragraphs immediately thereafter \" (s ) subscribe to stocks, shares, bonds or debentures Of industrial enterprises; 在 ) 1 ay out, deve lop and manage sites, parks, estates, identified zones and other premises fo r industries and businesses in Brunei Darussalam or elsewhere Via sale or lease Of specific site; ) foster the growth of the services industry by developing the appropriate infrastructure and formulating and implementing investment promotion plans, promotional incentives and marketing strategies to support local and international firms and businesses in the services sector in Brunei Darussalam, ( v ) facilitate n ew and existing companies in the implementation and operation Of their projects, and offer assistance through direct consultation and co-operation with the relevant authorities; (w ) exercise all functions and powers and perform all duties which under or by virtue Of any written law, are or may be or become vested or delegated to it; and\n\nBRUNEI DARUSSALAM GOVERNMENT GAZETTE 间 (x ) generally do all such matters and things as m ay be incidental to or consequential upon the exercise of its duties under this Act.'l by adding the following new subsection after subsection ( ) \" ( 2 》 For the purposes of paragraph ( of subsection (1), \"services\" means all or any of the following services 间 (b ) (d ) 仞 阆 @) financial and business servlces; engineering and technical servlces; information technology services; transport and communication services; warehousing and distribution servlces; accountancy and management and professional services; agrotechnology services; education servlces; medical servlces; publishing services; entertainment, leisure and recreation servlces; exhibition servlces; and a ny other services which the Minister m ay prescribe.\" lnsertion of new sections 9A, 9B and 9C."}},{"id":"BN-S-46-2001-BRUNEI-ECONOMIC-DEVELOPMENT-BOARD-ACT-AMEND-AC2F94-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7."},"text":{"en":"The Act is amended by inserting the following three new sections immediately after section 9 \"Directions by Minister. 9A. His majesty the Sultan and Yang Di-Pertuan may empower the Minister to give to the Board such directions, not inconsistent with the provisions Of this Act, as he considers fit, as to the exercise and performance by the Board of its powers, duties and functions under this Actf and the Board shall give effect to all such directions. 1284 0 0 20th* JUNET 2001 Appointments of committees and delegation Of powers, 9B. ( ) The Board mayt in its discretion, appoint from among its members or other persons who are not members Of the Board such number Of committees consisting Of members or other persons or members and other persons for the purposes which, in the opinion of the Board, would be better regulated and managed by means of those committees. 《 2 ) The Board may, subject to such conditions or restrictions as it thinks 血 , delegate to such committee or th e Chqirman or the Chief Executive Officer or any government agency all or any of the powers, functions and duties by this Act vested in the Board; and a ny power, function or duty so delegated may be exercised or performed by such committee or the Chairman or the Chief Executive Officer or government agency, as the case may be, in the name Of the Board. 〖 3 ) Th e Board may, subj ect to such conditions or restrictions as it thinks fit delegate to a ny employee thereof all or a ny of the Board's functions and duties by this Act vested in the Board, except the power to borrow money or to raise loans or grant loans or advances to or subscribe to or underwrite the issue Of stocks, shares, bonds or debentures Of business enterprises; an d any power, function or duty so delegated m ay be exercised or performed by such employee in the name of the Board. 《 4 ) The Board m ay continue to exerclse a ny p ower conferred upon it, or perform any function or duty under this Act, notwithstanding the delegation of such power, function or duty under this section. Appointment Of member to act on behalf of Chairman outside Brunei Darussalam. 9C. The Chairman of the Board may, with the approval of the Minister, appoint a member of the Board to perform the functions of the Chairman outside Brunei Darussalam ln relation to such matters or class Of matters as the Chairman may specify. ' Made this 28th. d ay of Safar, 1422 Hijriah corresponding to the 22nd. day of May, 2001 at Our lstana Nurul lman, Bandar Seri Begawan , Brunei Darussalam.\n\nHIS MAJESTY\n\nTHE SULTAN AND YANG DI-PERTUAN\n\nBRUNEI DARUSSALAM 1285"}}],"pack":"bn-p19","titleTranslation":{"engine":"llm","model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","reviewed":false,"batch":"CALR-TITLE-20261017-1801-BN-1261","source":"BRUNEI ECONOMIC DEVELOPMENT BOARD ACT AMENDMENT ORDER 2001","note":"由翻译 agent 按《法规标题中译规范》产出，经 tools/verify-title-return.js 机器校验后入库；尚未人工复核。"}};
